  "title": "Ta to na",
  "teTitle": "హల్లులు 2",
  "cefr": "A0",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "The tongue-curl row ట ఠ డ ఢ ణ and the soft dental row త థ ద ధ న.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u84-i01",
      "te": "ట",
      "audioTe": "ట. టమాటా.",
      "gloss": "Ta — as in 'Tamaataa' (tomato)",
      "words": [{ "te": "ట", "gloss": "Ta — hard t, tongue curled back (retroflex)" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u84-i02", "u84-i06"],
      "note": "Retroflex ట vs dental త is THE Telugu t-contrast: టమాటా has the hard one, తల (head) the soft one."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i02",
      "te": "ఠ",
      "audioTe": "ఠ. ఠీవి.",
      "gloss": "Tha — as in 'Theevi' (poise, dignity)",
      "words": [{ "te": "ఠ", "gloss": "Tha — ట with a puff of breath" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i01"],
      "note": "ఠ is a circle with a bar inside — don't mistake it for the open bowl of ట."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i03",
      "te": "డ",
      "audioTe": "డ. డబ్బు.",
      "gloss": "Da — as in 'Dabbu' (money)",
      "words": [{ "te": "డ", "gloss": "Da — hard d, tongue curled back" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u84-i04", "u84-i01"],
      "note": "డబ్బు (money) — a word you already haggle with. డ and ఢ differ only by ఢ's little tail."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i04",
      "te": "ఢ",
      "audioTe": "ఢ. ఢిల్లీ.",
      "gloss": "Dha — as in 'Dhillee' (Delhi)",
      "words": [{ "te": "ఢ", "gloss": "Dha — డ with a puff of breath" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i03"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i05",
      "te": "ణ",
      "audioTe": "ణ. బాణం.",
      "gloss": "Na — as in 'baaNam' (arrow)",
      "words": [{ "te": "ణ", "gloss": "Na — retroflex n, tongue curled back" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i03", "u84-i10"],
      "note": "ణ never begins a word — you'll always meet it mid-word, as in బాణం or కంఠాణి."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i06",
      "te": "త",
      "audioTe": "త. తల.",
      "gloss": "ta — as in 'tala' (head)",
      "words": [{ "te": "త", "gloss": "ta — soft t, tongue at the teeth (dental)" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u84-i01", "u84-i07"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i07",
      "te": "థ",
      "audioTe": "థ. రథం.",
      "gloss": "tha — as in 'ratham' (chariot)",
      "words": [{ "te": "థ", "gloss": "tha — త with a puff of breath" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i06", "u84-i02"],
      "note": "థ rarely starts a word; look for it inside words like రథం — the temple chariot."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i08",
      "te": "ద",
      "audioTe": "ద. దండ.",
      "gloss": "da — as in 'daNDa' (garland)",
      "words": [{ "te": "ద", "gloss": "da — soft d, tongue at the teeth" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u84-i09", "u84-i03"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i09",
      "te": "ధ",
      "audioTe": "ధ. ధనం.",
      "gloss": "dha — as in 'dhanam' (wealth)",
      "words": [{ "te": "ధ", "gloss": "dha — ద with a puff of breath" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i08"],
      "note": "ధ is ద wearing a check-mark on top — the mark is the puff of air."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i10",
      "te": "న",
      "audioTe": "న. నాన్న.",
      "gloss": "na — as in 'naanna' (dad)",
      "words": [{ "te": "న", "gloss": "na — everyday n, as in నేను (I)" }],
      "tags": ["consonant"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u84-i05", "u84-i06"],
      "note": "న opens నేను, నాన్న, నీళ్ళు — half the words you already speak. The other n, ణ, is the curled one."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i11",
      "te": "తల",
      "gloss": "tala — head",
      "words": [
        { "te": "త", "gloss": "ta" },
        { "te": "ల", "gloss": "la" }
      ],
      "tags": ["word"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i13", "u84-i12"],
      "note": "తల నొప్పి = headache — you've said it; now read its first half."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i12",
      "te": "దండ",
      "gloss": "daNDa — garland",
      "words": [
        { "te": "దం", "gloss": "dam — ద with the sunna hum" },
        { "te": "డ", "gloss": "Da" }
      ],
      "tags": ["word"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i11"],
      "note": "The sunna ం sits on ద and hums into the డ that follows: దం-డ. Both d-sounds in one word — soft ద, hard డ."
    },
    {
      "id": "u84-i13",
      "te": "నడక",
      "gloss": "naDaka — walk, gait",
      "words": [
        { "te": "న", "gloss": "na" },
        { "te": "డ", "gloss": "Da" },
        { "te": "క", "gloss": "ka" }
      ],
      "tags": ["word"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u84-i12", "u84-i11"]
    }
  ],
